VARIABLES
  distance       : how far you have walked  (progress)
  stamina        : spend to push on, recover by rest
  supplies       : food, water, salvage from wreckage
  burden         : cursed artifact weight  (grows over time)
  rot            : sickness in the land and in the remaining
  shelter        : temporary safety in ruins
  resolve        : whether you keep going or turn back
  artifact_state : carried / hidden / abandoned / used
  rings          : equippable items shown in trailer UI

FUNDAMENTALS
  Premise
    The rapture came and went.
    Those who remained grow sick.
    They scavenge the wreckage seeking shelter.
    You carry an ancient cursed object across a desolate medieval continent.

  Objective
    Survive the journey.
    Travel as far as possible.
    Decide what to do with the burden.

  Systems
    Stamina + supplies gate long walks on foot.
    Knowing when to advance or retreat is the real skill.
    The artifact warps movement and choices as it gets heavier.
    Persistence is the only score that matters.

  World
    Abandoned settlements, roads, ruins, landmarks.
    Interconnected bleak terrain.
    Dithered, tilt-shift look like filmed miniature sets.

  Content note
    Mature themes: fantasy violence, suicide depictions,
    criminal acts, profanity, alcohol and fantasy drugs.

